<tal:macros xmlns:tal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/tal"
            xmlns:metal="http://xml.zope.org/namespaces/metal">

  <tal:comment replace="nothing">
    Componenti condivisi (@@{{namespace}}-macros). Ogni macro dichiara le variabili che si aspetta dal chiamante.
  </tal:comment>

  <tal:comment replace="nothing">
    Pannello a sinistra nelle pagine di accesso (login e recupero password).
  </tal:comment>
  <metal:aside define-macro="login_aside">
    <div class="m-login__aside">
      <a class="m-logo" tal:attributes="href context/portal_url">{{namespace}}</a>
      <p class="m-login__claim">Area riservata</p>
    </div>
  </metal:aside>

</tal:macros>
